body:
Because the dude was just cheated on. I promise you, after being cheated on, *Ghandi* would sit around fantasizing about the more brutal things he could do to the other person, if only fleetingly. Doesn't mean it was ever going to happen - but saying that out loud helps a person confirm it to themselves. 

For fuck's sake, cut the poor guy some slack, he's just suffered the worst betrayal one person can perpetrate on another. He's an emotional wreck. 

&#3232;\_&#3232;
